 <p>Customize <code>study.slo_target</code>, <code>study.window</code> (W, seconds), <code>study.worth_threshold</code> and <code>config.lookback</code> (L, seconds) in the request. The bot changes a separate study copy with <code>accepted=false</code> and <code>study_assumption=true</code>; facts, gates, UIDs, move intervals, duration samples and ledger authority stay unchanged. Both W and L must fit genuine continuous history before every selected tick. Expanded windows also require the normalizer's complete retained-history contract. Insufficient history returns BLOCKED with requested and available seconds before either arm runs.</p>
